    "text": "BB needs new writers or some editors. The stabbings referred to in the article had northing at all to do with the victims being online \"influencers\". This tragic killing was personal - the murderer knew her and was angry because she did not pay him back money she owed him. The other episode was an attack on the victim by her former boyfriend. The references to them being influencers is not only clickbait, but ridiculous. And a blogger or influencer with less than 3000 followers really has very little \"influence\".",
